Everything else: none of the Jat'z Distribution models or sprites contains
Yuoki artwork. The freighter and depot concepts were AI-generated from text
prompts that describe the Yuoki style in words; the prompts are kept in
concepts/depots/prompts.json and assets/quinityn-freighter/source/. The
recorded inputs are text only; no Yuoki image is listed as a generator
input.


