AI-generated concept art
------------------------
These images were generated with an AI image generator:
  - concepts/depots/images/
  - approved-concept.png and the modeling turnaround in
    assets/quinityn-freighter/source/
The turnaround used approved-concept.png as its only image input. The
prompts are kept alongside the images. No exclusive copyright is claimed
over purely AI-generated elements.

The Blender models and the sprites rendered from them are separate,
human-made work, built with these concepts as visual references.


Development dependencies
------------------------
The Python packages in requirements.txt (NumPy, Pillow, OpenEXR) and
Blender are used only to build and check the artwork. They are not
included and keep their own licenses.


